## 2. Cross-sectional Forecasting Performance

- **IC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0689, std = 0.1448, ICIR = 0.48, HAC t-stat = 8.0 (lags=5)
- **RankIC (test)**:
  - mean = 0.0803, std = 0.1415, IR = 0.57, HAC t-stat = 9.6 (lags=5)
- 注：采用 Newey–West(HAC) t-stat 以处理日度序列的自相关/异方差。

